        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_ltroom",
        "screenadapt": "showall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_531_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, have you not heard this tune before?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Parvis"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, that's right, you joined after Rhine Lab's first New Year's party.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Parvis"
    },
    {
        "text": "We didn't have our own building back then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Parvis"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kristen rented half the floor of an office building next to the Trimounts Institute of Technology, and shared an old apartment with Saria nearby.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Parvis"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ferdinand talked about bringing in funding for us, but once he left his old job, his former associates stopped answering his mail.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Parvis"
    },
    {
        "text": "I was still at my old lab, and only went back to Trimounts a couple of times per month.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Parvis"
    },
    {
        "text": "On New Year's Eve, I got a message from Muelsyse ordering me to attend the party.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Parvis"
    },
    {
        "text": "It snowed heavily that night, and the roads back from Max D.C. were packed. I didn't want to go to all that effort, but Muelsyse didn't give me a choice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Parvis"
    },
    {
        "text": "She said she would soak my pillow in icy water if I didn't get back on time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Parvis"
    },
    {
        "text": "I stepped into the office, just before the clock struck twelve.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Parvis"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then I heard the song.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Parvis"
    },
    {
        "text": "It was a dreadful song.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Parvis"
    },
    {
        "text": "As a Leithanian, I have never understood, to this day, how Muelsyse, an authority on Originium Arts, could have such vulgar taste in music.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Parvis"
    },
    {
        "text": "But the others didn't seem bothered. Ferdinand asked Saria to dance with him, and she said yes. Could you believe it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Parvis"
    },
    {
        "text": "As for Kristen... she watched from the sides. That night, she spent more time looking at the people in the room than outside the window.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Parvis"
    },
    {
        "text": "Those days... I can hardly remember them now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Parvis"
    },
    {
        "text": "How did that song go?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Parvis"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sigh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Parvis"
    },
    {
        "text": "I suppose I really am getting old.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Parvis"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Parvis"
    },
